{"total_mates": 931, "patterns": [{"key": "back-rank-g7-g8", "title": "Mates on g7 / g8 and the castled king", "text": "Castling does not make you safe in crazyhouse - it tells your opponent where to aim. A pawn or queen dropped on g7/h7 supported by a piece ends the game. Before castling, count how many pieces the opponent holds in hand. Sometimes leaving the king in the centre, or walking it, is safer.", "count": 299, "examples": [{"game_id": "2BP9JF9Y", "ply": 101, "fen": "r4Bk1/pp3pP1/2p2np1/5pR1/2P5/1Pn1P2P/1p4K1/3n4[RBBPqqrbnppp] w - - 2 51", "mating_move": "R@h8#", "mating_uci": "R@h8", "my_color": "black", "date": "2026.08.15"}, {"game_id": "8c4Q87rp", "ply": 63, "fen": "r1b2rk1/p3ppb1/1p4pp/3pPnN1/b7/1p1NP3/nPpPBPPP/3R2K1[Qqr] w - - 0 32", "mating_move": "Q@h7#", "mating_uci": "Q@h7", "my_color": "black", "date": "2026.08.14"}, {"game_id": "n4B68H5g", "ply": 44, "fen": "r3k2N/ppp1b1p1/2np4/8/3P2Pn/2N3pP/PPPQBP1p/R1B2R1K[QRBPp] b q - 0 22", "mating_move": "@g2#", "mating_uci": "P@g2", "my_color": "white", "date": "2026.08.14"}, {"game_id": "qicmB7zO", "ply": 30, "fen": "rn3rk1/pp2ppbp/2pb1np1/7q/2N5/5B2/PPP1NPPP/R1B2RK1[QPpp] b - - 4 15", "mating_move": "Qxh2#", "mating_uci": "h5h2", "my_color": "white", "date": "2026.08.13"}, {"game_id": "oYRoRYTJ", "ply": 46, "fen": "rn2kb1B/pp2np2/2pp3p/6p1/NP2qn2/P1B5/1PP1BPPP/1R1Q1RK1[RPP] b q - 0 23", "mating_move": "Qxg2#", "mating_uci": "e4g2", "my_color": "white", "date": "2026.08.12"}, {"game_id": "wdnZXDwv", "ply": 73, "fen": "2R1bk2/3n1ppp/2Rp4/1p2pNb1/1P2np2/7P/BR2NPP1/4rBK1[QQPpppp] w - - 2 37", "mating_move": "Q@h8#", "mating_uci": "Q@h8", "my_color": "black", "date": "2026.08.11"}, {"game_id": "IVY5zpVE", "ply": 95, "fen": "r5k1/pppR2Pp/3p1r2/4p2B/4P2b/3PQ1Pp/PPP2P1P/6K1[RBqbnnnn] w - - 0 48", "mating_move": "R@h8#", "mating_uci": "R@h8", "my_color": "black", "date": "2026.08.10"}, {"game_id": "5McI5e9E", "ply": 52, "fen": "5b1r/3k1ppp/N2p4/1p1Bp3/3pP3/3P1N1q/PPP2P2/R1B2QK1[RNNPPrbp] b - - 0 26", "mating_move